{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"RedEyeNetworks.LogivoreForVeeam","latestVersion":"1.53.1","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Logivore plus Advanced Veeam Mode — collects, normalizes, and analyzes Veeam Backup and Replication logs end-to-end","license":"Proprietary","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Logivore plus Advanced Veeam Mode — collects, normalizes, and analyzes Veeam Backup and Replication logs end-to-end","license":"Proprietary","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Logivore for Veeam is the Veeam-centric SKU of Logivore. Includes\neverything in Logivore (cross-platform log analysis, LILA AI\nassistant, memory-tier-adaptive parsing, local-first trust-gated\nLLM boundary) plus Microsoft.PowerShell.SDK and a built-in\nAdvanced Veeam Mode that drives the Veeam VBR PowerShell cmdlets\nto collect job/repository/proxy diagnostics on demand. Targeted\nat Veeam backup administrators who need to triage failed jobs\nagainst backup server, repository, and proxy logs in one\ntimeline.","moniker":"logivore-for-veeam","name":"Logivore for Veeam","packageUrl":"https://redeyenetworks.com","publisher":"RedEye Network Solutions LLC","publisherUrl":"https://redeyenetworks.com","tags":["veeam","vbr","backup","log-analysis","log-viewer","syslog","evtx","powershell","ai","llm","claude","gemini","timeline","correlation","desktop"]}},"longDescription":"Logivore for Veeam is the Veeam-centric SKU of Logivore. Includes\neverything in Logivore (cross-platform log analysis, LILA AI\nassistant, memory-tier-adaptive parsing, local-first trust-gated\nLLM boundary) plus Microsoft.PowerShell.SDK and a built-in\nAdvanced Veeam Mode that drives the Veeam VBR PowerShell cmdlets\nto collect job/repository/proxy diagnostics on demand. Targeted\nat Veeam backup administrators who need to triage failed jobs\nagainst backup server, repository, and proxy logs in one\ntimeline.","moniker":"logivore-for-veeam","name":"Logivore for Veeam","packa